Read root AGENTS.md before making changes. In the protocol source repository, follow its template-maintenance instructions and do not create runtime records.

In installed target repositories, read .agent-protocol/AGENTS.md and installation.json to identify the selected tracker and canonical policies. Preserve existing project instructions. Do not assume both local tasks and GitHub Issues are authoritative.

This adapter points to the protocol; it does not define a separate workflow.
